{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finding herself in a dark room Diti tries to find what happened at this place by going through someone else\u2019s past experiences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a journey though all the supposed fears which may or may not be your own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather answers regarding incidents that took place which were deemed inhuman or even supernatural.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a new story as it begins to unfold in this first of many psychological horror installments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brief look at the story with a few plot points extracted from the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High end ray traced graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voices in Hindi language (All text in English)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In-game cutscenes (more in full version)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036340/extras/6ff479973c7ab8f5a254b7af7d75a9f1.poster.avif?t=1759023531\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036340/extras/6ff479973c7ab8f5a254b7af7d75a9f1.webm?t=1759023531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036340/extras/6ff479973c7ab8f5a254b7af7d75a9f1.mp4?t=1759023531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity system called State of Mind</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036340/extras/